Followup to #123738\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nBumps the SDK version in `global.json` to .NET 10, which appears to be the one remaining instance in the repo that still refers to .NET 8\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nAs our \"rollForward\" parameter pulls from the latest major version anyway, it's unlikely that most setups would run into issues, but it should prevent edge-cases where the wrong error is output if the only .NET available is less than 10\r\n\r\nAlso ensures that the \"version\" field uses the correct syntax[^1], as it turns out that the previous syntax might've not been appropriate in the first place? (should've been `8.0.100` instead of `8.0.0`)\r\n\r\n[^1]: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/core/tools/global-json#version","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123869/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123869/timeline","pe